WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.230
In 2018, a heavy rocket carried an unusual test payload: a car. It still orbits the Sun.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.380
The team from Arequipa chose a different payload.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:21.640
The Paulet 1: Pedro Paulet's Avion-Torpedo, built piece by piece from his drawing.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:23.750
<v Chicho>Every rivet where he drew it.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.200
Launch day. The whole of Arequipa holds its breath.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:39.000
More than a century later, Paulet's Avion-Torpedo is in space.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.640
<v Goicochea>Dear Pedro: we kept your promise. Now it belongs to them.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.790
Your turn.

